(6578084, 979821, 30861, '<td valign="top">Beautiful processing, Richard. I assume you''ll get hammered for not being "symmetrical" enough. Meanwhile, I have a totally asymmetrical riverscape made symmetrical by a perfect reflection, and processed over-the-top. Let''s see who scores higher; I''m curious. Feel free to chat with me on this.<br/> <br/>And if you''re NOT Richard Hahn reading this, for gawdsake let me know willya?<br/> <br/>Meanwhile, I love the asymmetrically symmetrical kind of take on things, so this is an 8 from me.</td>', 'Beautiful processing, Richard. I assume you''ll get hammered for not being "symmetrical" enough. Meanwhile, I have a totally asymmetrical riverscape made symmetrical by a perfect reflection, and processed over-the-top. Let''s see who scores higher; I''m curious. Feel free to chat with me on this. And if you''re NOT Richard Hahn reading this, for gawdsake let me know willya? Meanwhile, I love the asymmetrically symmetrical kind of take on things, so this is an 8 from me.', '2011-10-28 01:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
