(6578193, 980622, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''m a fan of architectural abstracts (what I''m assuming this is...). The grain is an interesting choice, but works well here.</td>', 'I''m a fan of architectural abstracts (what I''m assuming this is...). The grain is an interesting choice, but works well here.', '2011-10-28 03:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578195, 980818, 93565, '<td valign="top">If the fish had been a tiny tiny bit more vertical in the water this would''ve been much more remarkable. Still, I''m really liking the tone of the fish, the overall feel of things.</td>', 'If the fish had been a tiny tiny bit more vertical in the water this would''ve been much more remarkable. Still, I''m really liking the tone of the fish, the overall feel of things.', '2011-10-28 03:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578198, 980964, 93565, '<td valign="top">Love the simplicity. Easily one of the best uses of water for a reflection.</td>', 'Love the simplicity. Easily one of the best uses of water for a reflection.', '2011-10-28 03:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578199, 980828, 93565, '<td valign="top">The figure in this makes an otherwise ho-hum standard entry into something much more interesting. The dreamy look of the sky also adds to the mysterious feel of this shot. Well done.</td>', 'The figure in this makes an otherwise ho-hum standard entry into something much more interesting. The dreamy look of the sky also adds to the mysterious feel of this shot. Well done.', '2011-10-28 03:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578203, 980905, 93565, '<td valign="top">Your perspective does much to make this a visually perplexing shot. All the variety in the forms, the wood alongside the metal, a nice combination of divergent everything to make an interesting product.</td>', 'Your perspective does much to make this a visually perplexing shot. All the variety in the forms, the wood alongside the metal, a nice combination of divergent everything to make an interesting product.', '2011-10-28 03:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578204, 980895, 69368, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors here</td>', 'beautiful colors here', '2011-10-28 03:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578206, 980824, 93565, '<td valign="top">I noted on another entry that I really liked abstract architecture shots, and this one is just done wonderfully. Love the strong contrast.</td>', 'I noted on another entry that I really liked abstract architecture shots, and this one is just done wonderfully. Love the strong contrast.', '2011-10-28 03:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578207, 980855, 93565, '<td valign="top">Definitely needed you to stop down a bit more. The pattern on these guys does suit them very nicely for this challenge though.</td>', 'Definitely needed you to stop down a bit more. The pattern on these guys does suit them very nicely for this challenge though.', '2011-10-28 04:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578209, 980880, 69368, '<td valign="top">I would clowned out the power poles, and I prefer more blue in sky. Otherwise a nice shot</td>', 'I would clowned out the power poles, and I prefer more blue in sky. Otherwise a nice shot', '2011-10-28 04:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578214, 981009, 93565, '<td valign="top">Great perspective, and a nice example of looking at a completely ordinary object in an extraordinary way. <br/>I''m seeing some odd grey at the top, though, which is unfortunately distracting. It also seems ever so slightly tilted. Still a good shot in my book.</td>', 'Great perspective, and a nice example of looking at a completely ordinary object in an extraordinary way. I''m seeing some odd grey at the top, though, which is unfortunately distracting. It also seems ever so slightly tilted. Still a good shot in my book.', '2011-10-28 04:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578216, 980224, 93565, '<td valign="top">I love these sorts of photos. Tiny nitpick of the sky being lighter on the right. <strike>Still my favorite so far.</strike> <br/>Coming back after completing voting, this along with another are my two favorites from the challenge.</td>', 'I love these sorts of photos. Tiny nitpick of the sky being lighter on the right. Still my favorite so far. Coming back after completing voting, this along with another are my two favorites from the challenge.', '2011-10-28 04:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578217, 980983, 93565, '<td valign="top">Slightly different take on the challenge, and I really like where you''ve taken this. Great strong contrast, the total black of the shadow is excellent. I also like that we can still see her face, but that it isn''t illuminated, either. Tied for the highest vote I gave.</td>', 'Slightly different take on the challenge, and I really like where you''ve taken this. Great strong contrast, the total black of the shadow is excellent. I also like that we can still see her face, but that it isn''t illuminated, either. Tied for the highest vote I gave.', '2011-10-28 04:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578219, 980964, 69368, '<td valign="top">love the simplicity</td>', 'love the simplicity', '2011-10-28 04:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578220, 980984, 69368, '<td valign="top">much too busy for my eyes</td>', 'much too busy for my eyes', '2011-10-28 04:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
