(6578347, 979764, 15711, '<td valign="top">hee hee - we had a similar idea.  Yours is much better than mine.  Actually, fantastic. Spot on focus.</td>', 'hee hee - we had a similar idea.  Yours is much better than mine.  Actually, fantastic. Spot on focus.', '2011-10-28 10:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
