(6578394, 980465, 2337, '<td valign="top">I''m struggling to find symmetry here... Interesting patterns, nice tones and texture... But Symmetry?<br/> <br/>I''ll read through all alternative definitions of Symmetry and revisit this later</td>', 'I''m struggling to find symmetry here... Interesting patterns, nice tones and texture... But Symmetry? I''ll read through all alternative definitions of Symmetry and revisit this later', '2011-10-28 12:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578395, 980868, 2337, '<td valign="top">Wonderful tones!  Very well executed!</td>', 'Wonderful tones!  Very well executed!', '2011-10-28 12:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578398, 980889, 2337, '<td valign="top">Purists would say this is repetition and not symmetry.  I would disagree with them.  The shot doesn''t scream symmetry, but certainly contains some.  <br/> <br/>That said, the composition doesn''t haul me into the photo.  Perhaps a different angle or cropping would have worked for me...  Nice shot all in all,</td>', 'Purists would say this is repetition and not symmetry.  I would disagree with them.  The shot doesn''t scream symmetry, but certainly contains some.   That said, the composition doesn''t haul me into the photo.  Perhaps a different angle or cropping would have worked for me...  Nice shot all in all,', '2011-10-28 12:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578406, 980949, 2337, '<td valign="top">Stunning... Nailed the challenge, wonderful execution...  Grats of a great image</td>', 'Stunning... Nailed the challenge, wonderful execution...  Grats of a great image', '2011-10-28 12:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578407, 980400, 2337, '<td valign="top">hehehe... <br/> <br/>The composition feels a bit out of balance here...  Did you try this from different angles?  the left side of the photo seems full while the right side seems empty...  <br/> <br/>That make sense?</td>', 'hehehe...  The composition feels a bit out of balance here...  Did you try this from different angles?  the left side of the photo seems full while the right side seems empty...   That make sense?', '2011-10-28 12:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578411, 979988, 2337, '<td valign="top">The more I look at it the more I like it.  Strong vanishing lines.  Colors seem somehow "off"...</td>', 'The more I look at it the more I like it.  Strong vanishing lines.  Colors seem somehow "off"...', '2011-10-28 12:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578413, 979829, 2337, '<td valign="top">Took a while to see what this was.  Nice concept.  Not sure the angle worked as weel as it could have.  Tonal range seems a little lacking.  Nice shot all in all</td>', 'Took a while to see what this was.  Nice concept.  Not sure the angle worked as weel as it could have.  Tonal range seems a little lacking.  Nice shot all in all', '2011-10-28 12:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578417, 980597, 2337, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image!  A pure 10...  I''d say more but I''m speechless</td>', 'Wonderful image!  A pure 10...  I''d say more but I''m speechless', '2011-10-28 13:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578420, 979994, 2337, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the light swans on the dark water.  At first the angle bothered me, but it''s growing on me.  Adds a nice diagonal.  Nicely done</td>', 'I like the contrast of the light swans on the dark water.  At first the angle bothered me, but it''s growing on me.  Adds a nice diagonal.  Nicely done', '2011-10-28 13:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578422, 980936, 2337, '<td valign="top">Well done!  The rule of thirds is both applied and broken in just the right degrees.  Lower left distracted a little, but not much.  Congrats on a great shot</td>', 'Well done!  The rule of thirds is both applied and broken in just the right degrees.  Lower left distracted a little, but not much.  Congrats on a great shot', '2011-10-28 13:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578424, 981002, 2337, '<td valign="top">I''m left wishing there was more of the arch on the bottom revealed.  Interesting tones.  Very nicely done</td>', 'I''m left wishing there was more of the arch on the bottom revealed.  Interesting tones.  Very nicely done', '2011-10-28 13:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578486, 980683, 123907, '<td valign="top">Would have been better if the frame was level for the challenge.</td>', 'Would have been better if the frame was level for the challenge.', '2011-10-28 14:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578534, 980877, 16106, '<td valign="top">the shallow DOF is a bit disappointing, I like a strong textural study in rusty old things, And those are only present in the lights and the front grill. Nice tones and framing, but i miss that detail in the windshield and the cab.</td>', 'the shallow DOF is a bit disappointing, I like a strong textural study in rusty old things, And those are only present in the lights and the front grill. Nice tones and framing, but i miss that detail in the windshield and the cab.', '2011-10-28 15:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578536, 980912, 16106, '<td valign="top">Not wild about the orange sky and the letterbox frame, but the formalism is great and by far the best entry yet.</td>', 'Not wild about the orange sky and the letterbox frame, but the formalism is great and by far the best entry yet.', '2011-10-28 15:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578537, 980818, 16106, '<td valign="top">Avery nice image, perfectly lit to bring out the texture, but i don''t know why it was rotated into the vertical. It feels like the mismounted image in the slideshow where the audience tilts it''s head sideways to enjoy the image.</td>', 'Avery nice image, perfectly lit to bring out the texture, but i don''t know why it was rotated into the vertical. It feels like the mismounted image in the slideshow where the audience tilts it''s head sideways to enjoy the image.', '2011-10-28 15:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578540, 980622, 16106, '<td valign="top">The repetition of the form in overlapping shadows takes this from a "meh" shot to the land of the well rendered image.</td>', 'The repetition of the form in overlapping shadows takes this from a "meh" shot to the land of the well rendered image.', '2011-10-28 15:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578543, 980969, 16106, '<td valign="top">To make this simple image really work I would suggest getting as close as possible to the full 800 pixels, and really nailing the textures in post processing. The concept is sound and the colors are lovely, but you are stealing your own thunder.</td>', 'To make this simple image really work I would suggest getting as close as possible to the full 800 pixels, and really nailing the textures in post processing. The concept is sound and the colors are lovely, but you are stealing your own thunder.', '2011-10-28 15:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578544, 980607, 16106, '<td valign="top">A complex and beautiful symmetry and a beautiful B&amp;W conversion, just lovely tones.</td>', 'A complex and beautiful symmetry and a beautiful B&W conversion, just lovely tones.', '2011-10-28 15:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578548, 980977, 16106, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a bit flat, a more dramatic setup with more shadows and highlights on the book would have made this sing.</td>', 'The lighting is a bit flat, a more dramatic setup with more shadows and highlights on the book would have made this sing.', '2011-10-28 15:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578554, 981002, 16106, '<td valign="top">this is such a lovely subject, but at 800 pixels the details are muted, and the complexity eats itself into a muted field. Closer in, better light, more contrast, or just a larger canvas; I''m not sure where the ideal answer lies but something is missing.</td>', 'this is such a lovely subject, but at 800 pixels the details are muted, and the complexity eats itself into a muted field. Closer in, better light, more contrast, or just a larger canvas; I''m not sure where the ideal answer lies but something is missing.', '2011-10-28 15:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578630, 980592, 2337, '<td valign="top">The more I look the more I like it!  Rich tones, spot on composition.  Grats on a great image... 10</td>', 'The more I look the more I like it!  Rich tones, spot on composition.  Grats on a great image... 10', '2011-10-28 21:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6578632, 980370, 2337, '<td valign="top">Wonderful sky...  Very nice image.  The bridge certainly has an element of symmetry to it, but it is a very minor aspect of the shot.  I would not say that you made good use of symmetry here.</td>', 'Wonderful sky...  Very nice image.  The bridge certainly has an element of symmetry to it, but it is a very minor aspect of the shot.  I would not say that you made good use of symmetry here.', '2011-10-28 21:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
