(6578644, 980869, 2337, '<td valign="top">Nice image!  good concept.  I find myself wondering if you tried turning the 12 ball upside down, since the 2 upside down would look like a backward 5 so it would have looked almost like a backward 15...  Of course you may have tried it and found it didn''t work...<br/> <br/>Grats on a great shot.</td>', 'Nice image!  good concept.  I find myself wondering if you tried turning the 12 ball upside down, since the 2 upside down would look like a backward 5 so it would have looked almost like a backward 15...  Of course you may have tried it and found it didn''t work... Grats on a great shot.', '2011-10-28 22:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
