(6584488, 980597, 114969, '<td valign="top">My wife and I both shouted together "Jennifer!" when we saw this photo :-) You really know how to photography the human body, and the composition here is fabulous, so much talent. Congratulations on your ribbon!</td>', 'My wife and I both shouted together "Jennifer!" when we saw this photo :-) You really know how to photography the human body, and the composition here is fabulous, so much talent. Congratulations on your ribbon!', '2011-11-04 02:50:11.000000', NULL, 0),
