(6584710, 980912, 114969, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by gcoulson:</b></div><hr/><i> Christophe, what method in PP did you use to color the sky? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>A very simple method: just an orange "Photo Filter" in CS5, as well as a good amount of brightness. Raising brightness gave me of course lots of noise, so I used "Topaz Denoise" on it to keep it smooth.</td>', 'Originally posted by gcoulson: Christophe, what method in PP did you use to color the sky?   A very simple method: just an orange "Photo Filter" in CS5, as well as a good amount of brightness. Raising brightness gave me of course lots of noise, so I used "Topaz Denoise" on it to keep it smooth.', '2011-11-04 08:01:00.000000', NULL, 0),
